      "id": "msg_0046_00148",
      "en_US": "                                                                     "
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0046_00149",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! Here I’ll explain to you about\\n",
        "the Trainer Card.\\r",
        "Your Trainer Card, with your Pokémon of\\n",
        "course, is proof of your status as a\\f",
        "Pokémon Trainer while you’re out\\f",
        "adventuring.\\r",
        "It keeps automatic records of all kinds\\n",
        "of information.\\r",
        "If you touch the card, you can view the\\n",
        "reverse side.\\r",
        "You can sign the back of your card.\\r",
        "You can show off your signature to\\n",
        "anyone you meet in the Union Room!\\r",
        "But your signature will be erased if you\\n",
        "decide to sign your card again, so\\f",
        "be careful!"
      ]
    },
